{"seq":2,"slug":"effects-convolution","title":"效果与卷积混响","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-audio-sound-engineering/synthesis/effects-convolution","wordCount":1421,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"效果与卷积混响\">效果与卷积混响</h1><p>干巴巴的录音和「身临其境」之间，差的是空间和质感。同一句人声，加一点延迟变得空旷，过一点失真变得粗粝，扔进一座教堂的混响里就有了神性。这些效果在 Web Audio 里要么是专门的节点（延迟、失真、卷积），要么是基础节点的巧妙组合，把它们串成一条<strong>效果链</strong>，就是给声音「调色」的全过程。本节的压轴是卷积混响——它不靠近似算法,而是采下一个真实空间的声学指纹，用数学的卷积把任意声音「放进」那个空间，是 Web Audio 里最有魔力的一个节点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>效果链就是在源和目的之间串入一串处理节点，每个节点改造声音的一个侧面。除了已学的增益与滤波（见 <a href=\"../nodes/gain-filter-nodes\">增益与滤波节点</a>），合成处理常用的效果节点有三个：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  SRC[&quot;源 (干声)&quot;] --&gt; WS[&quot;WaveShaperNode&lt;br/&gt;失真·饱和&quot;]&#10;  WS --&gt; DLY[&quot;DelayNode&lt;br/&gt;回声·合唱&quot;]&#10;  DLY --&gt; CV[&quot;ConvolverNode&lt;br/&gt;卷积混响&quot;]&#10;  CV --&gt; WET[&quot;GainNode (wet)&quot;]&#10;  SRC --&gt; DRY[&quot;GainNode (dry)&quot;]&#10;  WET --&gt; OUT[&quot;destination&quot;]&#10;  DRY --&gt; OUT\">flowchart TD\n  SRC[\"源 (干声)\"] --&gt; WS[\"WaveShaperNode&lt;br/&gt;失真·饱和\"]\n  WS --&gt; DLY[\"DelayNode&lt;br/&gt;回声·合唱\"]\n  DLY --&gt; CV[\"ConvolverNode&lt;br/&gt;卷积混响\"]\n  CV --&gt; WET[\"GainNode (wet)\"]\n  SRC --&gt; DRY[\"GainNode (dry)\"]\n  WET --&gt; OUT[\"destination\"]\n  DRY --&gt; OUT</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节点</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>关键参数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>DelayNode</code></td>\n<td>回声、合唱、镶边</td>\n<td>延迟信号一段时间</td>\n<td><code>delayTime</code>（AudioParam，可调制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>WaveShaperNode</code></td>\n<td>失真、过载、饱和</td>\n<td>把输入按一条曲线非线性映射</td>\n<td><code>curve</code>（Float32Array）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ConvolverNode</code></td>\n<td>真实空间混响</td>\n<td>与脉冲响应做卷积</td>\n<td><code>buffer</code>（脉冲响应 AudioBuffer）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意图里的 <strong>dry/wet 并联</strong>结构：原始干声和处理后的湿声各接一个 GainNode 再汇合，调两个 gain 的比例就能控制效果的「浓度」。几乎所有效果都该这么接，而不是把干声完全替换——这是效果链设计的第一原则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"delaynode-从回声到合唱\">DelayNode：从回声到合唱</h2><p><code>DelayNode</code> 做的事一句话说清：把信号延后 <code>delayTime</code> 秒再输出。但它的威力在于反馈和调制。</p>\n<p>把延迟的输出绕回它的输入（经一个 &lt;1 的 gain 衰减），就得到<strong>逐渐衰减的回声</strong>——一种简易混响：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const delay = ctx.createDelay(2.0); // 最大延迟 2 秒&#10;delay.delayTime.value = 0.3; // 300ms 回声间隔&#10;const feedback = ctx.createGain();&#10;feedback.gain.value = 0.45; // 每次回声衰减到 45%，必须 &lt;1 否则无限放大&#10;source.connect(delay);&#10;delay.connect(feedback);&#10;feedback.connect(delay); // 反馈环: delay → gain → delay&#10;delay.connect(ctx.destination);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const delay = ctx.createDelay(2.0); // 最大延迟 2 秒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>delay.delayTime.value = 0.3; // 300ms 回声间隔</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const feedback = ctx.createGain();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>feedback.gain.value = 0.45; // 每次回声衰减到 45%，必须 &#x3C;1 否则无限放大</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>source.connect(delay);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>delay.connect(feedback);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>feedback.connect(delay); // 反馈环: delay → gain → delay</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>delay.connect(ctx.destination);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>delayTime</code> 是 AudioParam，用一个 LFO 轻微调制它（见 <a href=\"oscillator-synthesis\">振荡器合成</a> 的 LFO），就得到<strong>合唱（chorus）<strong>和</strong>镶边（flanger）</strong>——延迟随时间微微抖动，使单一声源听起来像好几个、或产生扫过的金属质感。反馈 gain 一定要小于 1，否则回声越叠越响直至爆掉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"waveshapernode-用曲线做失真\">WaveShaperNode：用曲线做失真</h2><p>失真的本质是非线性——让响的部分「削顶」或「压弯」，产生原信号里没有的谐波，从而变粗粝、变温暖。<code>WaveShaperNode</code> 给你一条任意的传递曲线 <code>curve</code>：输入值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x \\in [-1,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 被映射到 <code>curve</code> 上对应位置的输出值。曲线越弯，失真越重。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"function makeDistortionCurve(amount = 50) {&#10;  const n = 44100,&#10;    curve = new Float32Array(n);&#10;  const k = amount;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) {&#10;    const x = (i * 2) / n - 1; // x ∈ [-1, 1]&#10;    curve[i] =&#10;      ((3 + k) * x * 20 * Math.PI) /&#10;      180 / // 一条经典软削波曲线&#10;      (Math.PI + k * Math.abs(x));&#10;  }&#10;  return curve;&#10;}&#10;const shaper = ctx.createWaveShaper();&#10;shaper.curve = makeDistortionCurve(80);&#10;shaper.oversample = &#39;4x&#39;; // 过采样减少失真带来的混叠杂音\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function makeDistortionCurve(amount = 50) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const n = 44100,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    curve = new Float32Array(n);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const k = amount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (let i = 0; i &#x3C; n; i++) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const x = (i * 2) / n - 1; // x ∈ [-1, 1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    curve[i] =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ((3 + k) * x * 20 * Math.PI) /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      180 / // 一条经典软削波曲线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (Math.PI + k * Math.abs(x));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return curve;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const shaper = ctx.createWaveShaper();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>shaper.curve = makeDistortionCurve(80);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>shaper.oversample = '4x'; // 过采样减少失真带来的混叠杂音</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>oversample</code> 设 <code>&#39;4x&#39;</code> 很重要：失真产生的高次谐波可能超过奈奎斯特频率（见 <a href=\"../foundations/sampling-buffers\">采样与缓冲</a>）而混叠成刺耳杂音，过采样在更高采样率下计算再降回来能压制它。一条直线（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>）是无失真，越偏离直线失真越强；用 <code>tanh</code> 类曲线得温暖的软饱和，用硬削顶得激进的过载。</p>\n<h2 id=\"convolvernode-把声音放进真实空间\">ConvolverNode：把声音放进真实空间</h2><p>卷积混响是本节的主角，也是 Web Audio 最优雅的设计之一。它的思路颠覆直觉：不去用算法<strong>近似</strong>一个房间的混响，而是先采下那个房间的<strong>脉冲响应</strong>（impulse response, IR）——在房间里放一声极短的脉冲（拍手、气球爆),录下它在墙壁间反射、衰减的全过程,这段录音就完整编码了这个空间的声学特性。然后把任意干声和这段 IR 做<strong>卷积</strong>,数学上等价于「让这段声音在那个房间里响一遍」。</p>\n<p>卷积的定义是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∗</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y(t) = (x * h)(t) = \\int x(\\tau)\\,h(t-\\tau)\\,d\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.3061em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>,其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 是干声、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 是脉冲响应。直觉上,输出的每一刻都是输入信号被脉冲响应「拖尾」叠加的结果——IR 里每一个反射回声都被复制到信号的每一个采样上。这正解释了为什么 <a href=\"../foundations/sampling-buffers\">采样与缓冲</a> 说脉冲响应「就是某个空间的声学指纹」。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// 加载一段真实空间的脉冲响应(教堂、音乐厅、隧道…)&#10;const ir = await fetch(&#39;cathedral-ir.wav&#39;)&#10;  .then((r) =&gt; r.arrayBuffer())&#10;  .then((b) =&gt; ctx.decodeAudioData(b)); // IR 也是普通 AudioBuffer&#10;&#10;const convolver = ctx.createConvolver();&#10;convolver.buffer = ir; // 设上脉冲响应即生效&#10;&#10;// dry/wet 并联控制混响浓度&#10;const dry = ctx.createGain(),&#10;  wet = ctx.createGain();&#10;dry.gain.value = 0.7;&#10;wet.gain.value = 0.4;&#10;source.connect(dry).connect(ctx.destination);&#10;source.connect(convolver).connect(wet).connect(ctx.destination);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 加载一段真实空间的脉冲响应(教堂、音乐厅、隧道…)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const ir = await fetch('cathedral-ir.wav')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  .then((r) => r.arrayBuffer())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  .then((b) => ctx.decodeAudioData(b)); // IR 也是普通 AudioBuffer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const convolver = ctx.createConvolver();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>convolver.buffer = ir; // 设上脉冲响应即生效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// dry/wet 并联控制混响浓度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const dry = ctx.createGain(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  wet = ctx.createGain();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dry.gain.value = 0.7;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wet.gain.value = 0.4;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>source.connect(dry).connect(ctx.destination);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>source.connect(convolver).connect(wet).connect(ctx.destination);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>换一段 IR 文件,同一句人声就从教堂搬到了浴室、隧道、或某把特定吉他箱体里——你甚至能用非空间的 IR 做特殊音染。卷积混响的代价是<strong>计算昂贵</strong>:IR 越长(混响越久),每个采样要做的乘加越多,这也是 <a href=\"../practice/spatial-audio\">空间音频与声像</a> 里 HRTF 和 <a href=\"../practice/audio-performance\">音频性能与延迟</a> 里性能权衡的同一个根因——卷积是 Web Audio 里最吃 CPU 的运算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"串联成链-顺序很重要\">串联成链:顺序很重要</h2><p>把这些效果串起来时,<strong>顺序改变结果</strong>。失真在混响之前还是之后,听感天差地别:</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;干声 → 失真 → 混响&quot;] --&gt; A2[&quot;先变粗粝, 再放进空间&lt;br/&gt;(粗粝声在房间里回响, 自然)&quot;]&#10;  B[&quot;干声 → 混响 → 失真&quot;] --&gt; B2[&quot;先放进空间, 再整体失真&lt;br/&gt;(连混响尾巴一起削, 脏而密)&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"干声 → 失真 → 混响\"] --&gt; A2[\"先变粗粝, 再放进空间&lt;br/&gt;(粗粝声在房间里回响, 自然)\"]\n  B[\"干声 → 混响 → 失真\"] --&gt; B2[\"先放进空间, 再整体失真&lt;br/&gt;(连混响尾巴一起削, 脏而密)\"]</pre><p>通用经验:动态/音色类(压缩、失真、EQ)放前,空间类(延迟、混响)放后;调制类(合唱)看意图。每段效果都用 dry/wet 并联保留干声比例,最后用一个 master gain 汇总(见 <a href=\"../nodes/gain-filter-nodes\">增益与滤波节点</a> 的混音总线)。一条设计良好的效果链,是音频产品「质感」的全部来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>效果链是源与目的间串入的处理节点序列;每段效果都该用 dry/wet 并联保留干声比例,而非整体替换。</li>\n<li>DelayNode 延后信号:加反馈环(gain&lt;1)得衰减回声,用 LFO 调制 <code>delayTime</code> 得合唱/镶边。</li>\n<li>WaveShaperNode 用任意曲线做非线性失真;<code>oversample=&#39;4x&#39;</code> 压制失真混叠杂音。</li>\n<li>ConvolverNode 用真实空间的脉冲响应做卷积 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∗</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=x*h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4653em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>,把干声「放进」那个空间;换 IR 即换空间,代价是卷积极吃 CPU。</li>\n<li>效果顺序改变结果:音色类在前、空间类在后;整链用 master gain 汇总。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>效果链复用的增益、滤波、混音总线:<a href=\"../nodes/gain-filter-nodes\">增益与滤波节点</a></li>\n<li>脉冲响应作为 AudioBuffer 的数据本质:<a href=\"../foundations/sampling-buffers\">采样与缓冲</a></li>\n<li>用 LFO 调制 delayTime 的调制原理:<a href=\"oscillator-synthesis\">振荡器合成</a></li>\n<li>卷积同样支撑的 HRTF 空间化:<a href=\"../practice/spatial-audio\">空间音频与声像</a></li>\n<li>卷积为何是性能热点:<a href=\"../practice/audio-performance\">音频性能与延迟</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"效果与卷积混响","id":"效果与卷积混响"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"DelayNode：从回声到合唱","id":"delaynode-从回声到合唱"},{"level":2,"text":"WaveShaperNode：用曲线做失真","id":"waveshapernode-用曲线做失真"},{"level":2,"text":"ConvolverNode：把声音放进真实空间","id":"convolvernode-把声音放进真实空间"},{"level":2,"text":"串联成链:顺序很重要","id":"串联成链-顺序很重要"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"振荡器合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-audio-sound-engineering/synthesis/oscillator-synthesis"},"next":{"title":"Audio Worklet 自定义处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-audio-sound-engineering/synthesis/audio-worklet"}}